{
  "uid": "ecommerce-overview",
  "title": "Ecommerce - Overview",
  "tags": ["ecommerce", "overview"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "log_stream",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
        "query": "label_values(container)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Services Up",
      "description": "Scrape target health. 9 targets: 7 app services, prometheus itself and rabbitmq.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(up{job!=\"prometheus\"})",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 7 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 8 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests / sec (5m)",
      "description": "Only auth-service exposes a real HTTP histogram (Spring actuator). The .NET services expose hand-rolled counters, see the note panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"auth-service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "auth-service"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "colorMode": "value", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 Latency (auth-service)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{job=\"auth-service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "colorMode": "value", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 Latency by service (non-JVM)",
      "description": "prometheus client libraries (order/catalog/payment) report http_request_duration_seconds_bucket; the JVM reports http_server_requests_seconds_bucket and is covered by the auth-service stat panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, job) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"order-service|catalog-service|payment-service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, job) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=~\"order-service|catalog-service|payment-service\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} p50"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP Error Rate by service (5xx)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 40 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_requests_total{job=~\"order-service|catalog-service|payment-service\", code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or on() vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} 5xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"auth-service\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or on() vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} 5xx (jvm)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RabbitMQ Messages In Queue",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages)",
          "legendFormat": "queued"
        }
      ],
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "colorMode": "value", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 100 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1000 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Target Health (up)",
      "description": "1 = scrape succeeded, 0 = target down. A dip here means the service or its port is gone.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "up{job!=\"prometheus\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Service Uptime",
      "description": "Container uptime from process_start_time_seconds. A flat line means a restart, not necessarily a crash - check the logs panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "time() - process_start_time_seconds{job!=\"prometheus\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "stacking": { "mode": "none" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM Heap (auth-service)",
      "description": "auth-service is the only JVM service with a real actuator endpoint. The `id` label holds G1 pool names (Eden / Old Gen / Survivor), so usage is summed per pool; the flat line is the total heap ceiling.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (id) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=\"auth-service\", area=\"heap\"})", "legendFormat": "{{id}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{job=\"auth-service\", area=\"heap\"})", "legendFormat": "heap max" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC Pause (auth-service)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (action) (rate(jvm_gc_pause_seconds_sum{job=\"auth-service\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RabbitMQ Queue Depth",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (queue) (rabbitmq_queue_messages)", "legendFormat": "{{queue}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (queue) (rabbitmq_queue_messages_unacked)", "legendFormat": "{{queue}} unacked" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RabbitMQ Publish / Deliver Rate",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_received_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "received (published)" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_delivered_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "delivered" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_unroutable_returned_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "unroutable" },
        { "refId": "D", "expr": "rate(rabbitmq_global_messages_redelivered_total[5m])", "legendFormat": "redelivered" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Process Resources",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{job!=\"prometheus\"} or process_working_set_bytes{job!=\"prometheus\"}", "legendFormat": "{{job}} rss" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{job!=\"prometheus\"}[5m])", "legendFormat": "{{job}} cpu" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Container Logs (Loki)",
      "description": "Streamed from Loki via promtail. Use the stream variable to filter by container.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=~\"${log_stream:regex}\"}",
          "showTime": true,
          "wrapLogMessage": true,
          "sortOrder": "Descending",
          "enableLogDetails": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Telemetry status in this stack",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 48 },
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "**Instrumentation per service**\n\n| Service | Stack | HTTP latency | Status codes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `auth-service` | Java / Spring + Micrometer | `http_server_requests_seconds` | yes |\n| `order-service` | .NET 8 + prometheus-net | `http_request_duration_seconds` | yes |\n| `catalog-service` | Go + client_golang | `http_request_duration_seconds` | yes |\n| `payment-service` | Python + prometheus_client | `http_request_duration_seconds` | yes |\n| `analytics-service` | Python + prometheus_client | business counters only | n/a (no HTTP API besides `/summary`) |\n| `api-gateway` | Node + prom-client | runtime metrics only | no |\n| `cart-service` | Node | runtime metrics only | no |\n\nTwo naming conventions coexist by design: Micrometer (`http_server_*`) for the JVM, the Prometheus client libraries (`http_request_*`) everywhere else. Panels query both.\n\nRSS is also reported under two names: `process_resident_memory_bytes` (Node, Python) and `process_working_set_bytes` (.NET), so the Process Resources panel merges them with `or`." }
    }
  ]
}
